eat Atta\";}i:4;a:5:{s:4:\"name\";s:5:\"Priya\";s:8:\"location\";s:9:\"Bengaluru\";s:6:\"rating\";i:5;s:4:\"text\";s:106:\"Honey crystallised in winter and they had already explained why on the jar. Tastes like real forest honey.\";s:7:\"product\";s:16:\"Raw Forest Honey\";}i:5;a:5:{s:4:\"name\";s:6:\"Nikhil\";s:8:\"location\";s:5:\"Noida\";s:6:\"rating\";i:4;s:4:\"text\";s:89:\"Packaging is clean, the dal cooks quickly and it is unpolished as promised. Will reorder.\";s:7:\"product\";s:8:\"Toor Dal\";}}s:13:\"story_heading\";s:40:\"Our Farmers Are the Heart of Our Purpose\";s:10:\"story_text\";s:304:\"Every grain, dal and spice comes from small farmer collectives across twelve Indian states. We agree prices above the mandi rate before sowing, pay within seven days of delivery and fund natural-farming training.\n\nWhen farmers thrive, the food on your table is better — and so is the land it came from.\";s:11:\"story_image\";s:100:\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464226184884-fa280b87c399?w=1000&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=1200\";s:15:\"story_cta_label\";s:10:\"Learn more\";s:13:\"story_cta_url\";s:6:\"/about\";s:11:\"story_stats\";a:4:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:6:\"1,200+\";s:5:\"label\";s:15:\"Partner farmers\";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:2:\"12\";s:5:\"label\";s:13:\"Indian states\";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:4:\"100%\";s:5:\"label\";s:18:\"Lab-tested batches\";}i:3;a:2:{s:5:\"value\";s:3:\"10+\";s:5:\"label\";s:17:\"Years of sourcing\";}}s:18:\"newsletter_heading\";s:22:\"Sign Up To Get Updates\";s:15:\"newsletter_text\";s:54:\"Recipes, harvest news and ₹100 off your first order.\";s:12:\"story_slides\";a:2:{i:0;a:8:{s:7:\"eyebrow\";s:17:\"From our kitchens\";s:7:\"heading\";s:47:\"Slow-cooked traditions, stone-ground every week\";s:4:\"text\";s:129:\"Our atta, spices and oils are milled in small batches so every pack reaches your kitchen fresh — never bleached, never refined.\";s:9:\"cta_label\";s:15:\"Explore staples\";s:7:\"cta_url\";s:5:\"/shop\";s:9:\"video_