1375761-83865001e31c?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Our rice and grains come from single-origin cooperative farms — aged basmati from Punjab, red matta rice from Kerala and foxtail, little and barnyard millets from Karnataka. Every lot is sun-dried, cleaned by hand and milled close to dispatch so it reaches you fresh.</p><h3>How to choose</h3><p>Pick aged basmati for biryani and pulao, sona masoori for everyday meals, and millets for a fibre-rich, low-GI alternative to polished rice.</p>',3),(52,NULL,'Pulses & Dals','pulses-dals','Unpolished, protein-rich','Unpolished, protein-rich','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515543904379-3d757afe72e4?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Unpolished dals keep their natural bran and protein. Ours are cleaned without oil or water polish, so they cook faster and taste of the field, not the factory.</p>',3),(53,NULL,'Flour & Atta','flour-atta','Stone-ground, fresh every week','Stone-ground, fresh every week','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574323347407-f5e1ad6d020b?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Stone-grinding keeps the wheat germ and bran in the flour. We mill in small batches every week — the date is printed on every pack.</p>',3),(54,NULL,'Spices & Masalas','spices-masalas','Sun-dried and freshly ground','Sun-dried and freshly ground','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532336414038-cf19250c5757?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Whole spices from Kerala, Andhra and Rajasthan, ground in small batches for maximum aroma. No fillers, no colours.</p>',3),(55,NULL,'Oils & Ghee','oils-ghee','Cold-pressed oils, bilona ghee','Cold-pressed oils, bilona ghee','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1474979266404-7eaacbcd87c5?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,4,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Wood-pressed (kachi ghani) oils retain their natural aroma and nutrients. Our ghee is churned from curd the traditional bilona way.</p>',3),(56,NULL,'Sweeteners & Honey','sweeteners','Jaggery, raw honey, khandsari','Jaggery, raw honey, khandsari','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1471943311424-646960669fbc?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Unrefined sweeteners with their minerals intact — organic jaggery, raw forest honey and khandsari sugar.</p>',3),(57,NULL,'Tea & Beverages','tea-beverages','Estate teas and traditional blends','Estate teas and traditional blends','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571934811356-5cc061b6821f?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Assam and Darjeeling estate teas, masala chai blends and herbal infusions.</p>',3),(58,NULL,'Health & Wellness','health-wellness','Ayurvedic staples and superfoods','Ayurvedic staples and superfoods','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615485500704-8e990f9900f7?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,8,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Turmeric, moringa, ashwagandha and other traditional wellness foods, tested for purity.</p>',3),(59,NULL,'Organic Foods','organic-foods','Certified organic, farm to pack','Certified organic, farm to pack','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464226184884-fa280b87c399?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,9,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Everything in this section is India Organic and NPOP certified — grown without synthetic fertilisers or pesticides.</p>',3),(60,NULL,'Snacks','snacks','Roasted, baked, honest','Roasted, baked, honest','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1601050690597-df0568f70950?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,10,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Roasted makhana, baked chips, trail mixes and traditional namkeen — no palm oil, no MSG.</p>',3),(61,NULL,'Gift Boxes','gift-boxes','Festive hampers','Festive hampers','https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512909006721-3d6018887383?w=900&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop&h=900',1,1,11,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:42','2026-09-18 01:19:42','heritage','<p>Curated hampers of dry fruits, spices, ghee and teas in reusable boxes — for Diwali, weddings and housewarmings.</p>',3),(62,51,'Basmati Rice','basmati-rice',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3),(63,51,'Everyday Rice','everyday-rice',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3),(64,51,'Millets','millets',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3),(65,51,'Poha & Flattened Grains','poha-flattened-grains',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,3,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3),(66,52,'Toor, Moong & Urad','toor-moong-urad',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3),(67,52,'Chana & Rajma','chana-rajma',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3),(68,52,'Masoor & Mixed','masoor-mixed',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,2,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3),(69,53,'Wheat Atta','wheat-atta',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3),(70,53,'Millet & Multigrain Flours','millet-flours',NULL,NULL,NULL,1,1,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,'2026-09-18 01:19:43','2026-09-18 01:19:43','heritage',NULL,3